<title>HUNGARY: Budapest bourse closed December 24 to 27.</title>
<headline>Budapest bourse closed December 24 to 27.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange (BSE) will be closed on December 24, 25, 26 and 27, a BSE statement released on Thursday said.</p>
<p>In 1997, the BSE will be closed on January 1, 2 and 3, March 31, May 1, May 19, August 20, October 23 and December 24, 25 and 26.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
